# The week-trend floor caps at YELLOW (banshee-nio): a two-week horizon is a
# standing debt to schedule, not an emergency, and red stays owned by bytes and
# the ten-minute projection. Promoting the arm to Red hands the crisis band to
# a forecast that reverses over days — banshee-wql's complaint at week scale.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/disk.rs
test: the_week_trend_caps_at_yellow_and_never_touches_severity
---OLD---
            Some(p) if p <= alert_secs => Band::Yellow,
---NEW---
            Some(p) if p <= alert_secs => Band::Red,
